sn6.14:8.1 | S: Having inspired that divinity, his assembly, and his retinue with a sense of awe, | T: “Then—having struck terror in Brahmā, Brahmā’s retinue, & Brahmā’s assembly—Sikhī the Blessed One, worthy & fully self-awakened, & the monk Abhibhū—
